-- Tests for the coverage rows of the Ordinance's repealed sections and subsections: what Law s 31 leaves of the Ordinance.
-- Law s 31 repeals the Ordinance except ss 16(2), 16(4), 17, 19 and 42. Every other section (1 to 15, 18, 20 to 41, 43; ss 2 to 15, 18,
-- 20 to 41 and 43 read "(בוטל)" in the text, and s 1 survives only through the note of Law s 1, fork F15) must come out as not surviving,
-- and every subsection of s 16 must come out as the text of s 31 says. Expected values come from the list in s 31 and from nothing else.

§ `Tests: what Law s 31 leaves of the Ordinance`

§§ `Every section of the Ordinance, one by one`

